    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.poster.avif?t=1753016677\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.webm?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.mp4?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The girl and the golem fall into the golem kingdom of [Sophiatica].</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of [Sophiatica], once built by alchemists, has now fallen into ruin.<br>Now, it is a den of masterless golems roaming without purpose.<br>Mercouri, a girl wielding a book, and Hando, a hand-shaped golem, have fallen into this kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To revive their friend Hadel, they embark on a journey to find his soul, the Pangenium.<br>The Pangenium has shattered into eight pieces and scattered across the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting foot in Sophiatica, Mercouri and Hando move forward together, helping one another.<br>What secrets and trials await them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.poster.avif?t=1753016677\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.webm?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.mp4?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch characters to outsmart the golems.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri runs across the ground, while Hando flies through the air.<br>But neither of them is perfect.<br>Short Mercouri can\u2019t reach high places, and golem Hando can\u2019t pick up items or interact with objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By switching between the two characters, they can compensate for each other\u2019s weaknesses.<br>Hando helps Mercouri reach higher places, and aerial enemies can be tackled by Hando.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful foes must be lured and defeated through clever character switching.<br>Solve puzzles that one character alone cannot, and win battles by outsmarting the golems! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mercouri \u2013 The girl who wields the book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri is a small and seemingly insignificant alchemist girl.<br>She attacks enemies with a flurry of strikes from her soul-infused book.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hando \u2013 The floating fist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hando is a dependable golem who supports the untrustworthy Mercouri.<br>He floats through the air, defeating high-up enemies and discovering hidden items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.poster.avif?t=1753016677\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.webm?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.mp4?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden paths, the kingdom of eight hues, and the NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophiatica is a kingdom composed of uniquely themed areas\u2014<br>from underground waterways, blazing hot mining zones, to the climate gardens above the clouds.<br>Each area hides secret paths, items, and mechanics.<br>With a bit of attention, you\u2019ll uncover the kingdom\u2019s subtle secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vast and interconnected kingdom is also home to NPCs with their own stories.<br>As Mercouri and Hando go on their adventure, so too do the inhabitants continue their own journeys. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.poster.avif?t=1753016677\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.webm?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.mp4?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The girl and the golem fall into the golem kingdom of [Sophiatica].</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of [Sophiatica], once built by alchemists, has now fallen into ruin.<br>Now, it is a den of masterless golems roaming without purpose.<br>Mercouri, a girl wielding a book, and Hando, a hand-shaped golem, have fallen into this kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To revive their friend Hadel, they embark on a journey to find his soul, the Pangenium.<br>The Pangenium has shattered into eight pieces and scattered across the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting foot in Sophiatica, Mercouri and Hando move forward together, helping one another.<br>What secrets and trials await them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.poster.avif?t=1753016677\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.webm?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.mp4?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch characters to outsmart the golems.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri runs across the ground, while Hando flies through the air.<br>But neither of them is perfect.<br>Short Mercouri can\u2019t reach high places, and golem Hando can\u2019t pick up items or interact with objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By switching between the two characters, they can compensate for each other\u2019s weaknesses.<br>Hando helps Mercouri reach higher places, and aerial enemies can be tackled by Hando.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful foes must be lured and defeated through clever character switching.<br>Solve puzzles that one character alone cannot, and win battles by outsmarting the golems! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mercouri \u2013 The girl who wields the book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri is a small and seemingly insignificant alchemist girl.<br>She attacks enemies with a flurry of strikes from her soul-infused book.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hando \u2013 The floating fist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hando is a dependable golem who supports the untrustworthy Mercouri.<br>He floats through the air, defeating high-up enemies and discovering hidden items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.poster.avif?t=1753016677\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.webm?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.mp4?t=1753016677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden paths, the kingdom of eight hues, and the NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophiatica is a kingdom composed of uniquely themed areas\u2014<br>from underground waterways, blazing hot mining zones, to the climate gardens above the clouds.<br>Each area hides secret paths, items, and mechanics.<br>With a bit of attention, you\u2019ll uncover the kingdom\u2019s subtle secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vast and interconnected kingdom is also home to NPCs with their own stories.<br>As Mercouri and Hando go on their adventure, so too do the inhabitants continue their own journeys. </p>",
    "short_description": "For Mercuri, a girl who fell into a fallen kingdom, everything is overwhelming. She digs deeper into the depths of the kingdom with the help of Golem Hando. Take down the enemies in front of you with TAG-ACTION that alternates between two characters and continue your exploration!",
